Advanced Defense is a skill that seeks to increase the benefit 
of a combatant's defensive abilities, beyond the basics of the 
Defense skill.
 
Firstly, while in Defensive attack mode, a combatant will receive
greater reward to not only their defense but also their offense. 
After all, the secret to a good offense is good defense.

Secondly, while in Defensive attack mode and holding a shield, a
tanking combatant will sometimes trigger a skill ability. This
ability adds an AC bonus equal to your skill level, and that bonus
becomes the likelihood that the next successful attack against the
combatant will be blocked outright. This block will remove the
effect, allowing it to restart the process.

Because this skill requires the combatant to be in the Defensive
attack mode, it is not compatible with Berserk or the Advanced
Berserk combat style. To a defensive specialist, recklessness is
tentamount to foolishness. A defensive specialist elevates from a
simple meat shield into a genuine threat.
